      "text": "The number of bacteria B in a culture changes at a rate proportional to B, where t is measured in hours. At \\( t = 0 \\), \\( B = 380 \\) bacteria, and at \\( t = 1 \\), \\( B = 152 \\) bacteria. Find an expression for \\( B(t) \\).",
